#: omake:omake_FC88912E_2931_41A4_92DD_9E4111F94673
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f462fc0cc0bf41e6bd9d90b1c55348b70a8962be7df37035661353aac18fc7d1
#. default-sha256: fb54b68c0c1ec0968d56884e9b3cd927436d5d64fd9754dbae86bbedc52031d0
msgctxt "omake:omake_FC88912E_2931_41A4_92DD_9E4111F94673"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, never mind that for now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……뭐 됐어. ⟪k:3⟫지금은 자잘한 건 신경 끌래."

#: omake:omake_842EAA67_89AC_4204_B51D_994B16A9A5B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0e77e1deb8a29719838f1842b03e0747befdca5f77bf3241a0f7d2c7a6f9d18
#. default-sha256: 62f899549d7339cf6bee5b90a504487659664f9500158d03168a257bac205701
msgctxt "omake:omake_842EAA67_89AC_4204_B51D_994B16A9A5B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would ask you what you thought of it,⟪k:1⟫but unfortunately, that is beyond even my powers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네가 어떤 감정을 품고 있는지, ⟪k:1⟫그걸 말로 못 들어서 아쉬운걸."

#: omake:omake_F9A09CB9_71D9_41BD_8D28_DFAE4B4D5048
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 403e07d666d91baad3c095d022f545f9415960d79c7c00d59f0abdfeb4e8f5f9
#. default-sha256: 21f8760ee43155d15c3ccc5e9464cee50d5a1759cf0ef16176fdde13317b4f2e
msgctxt "omake:omake_F9A09CB9_71D9_41BD_8D28_DFAE4B4D5048"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...You’ve got a strong stomach, at least."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래……, ⟪k:3⟫담력이 있구나."

#: omake:omake_3D14B59C_669A_473A_81E7_82B165B4E507
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb45b41cbc1cb72e10daa96ee7d7390281364d8a1305b7fa4af461152a608f2e
#. default-sha256: 80dc6c84064bf07c6b8700de0667dd17d425e191d552b8d73991c98fad429371
msgctxt "omake:omake_3D14B59C_669A_473A_81E7_82B165B4E507"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Before we begin our little trek, I would like to emphasize that this is,⟪k:3⟫as "
"the title implies, a look behind the curtains of ⟪k:4⟫The House in Fata Morgana⟪k:5⟫."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그럼 바로 가자고…… ⟪k:3⟫하고 싶은데, ⟪k:4⟫타이틀에 적힌 대로 여긴 무대 뒤야."

#: omake:omake_5973E007_064C_48B3_A4D6_641D2CD416FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 395079ea64418f259ed9f6f5209f5046d6b9f526f2ba3059d95aa652a7cbc626
#. default-sha256: fa5791f83fbba8d22a5edb21428a4093cd19bc3c8d4d21746f00e478fed6fda4
msgctxt "omake:omake_5973E007_064C_48B3_A4D6_641D2CD416FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’ll be making your way into the heads of the staff themselves,⟪k:1⟫and I promise you—⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫it’s not a pretty sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도 가겠다면 ⟪k:2⟫가자.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제작진의 주저리가 막 나오는 무대 뒤로."

#: omake:omake_8A3E8667_5714_4479_945B_89A82141E83A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4ad0da166ad2dbbe899100384ef54fba52a059e402d83ebcf71d34fe816f2c5
#. default-sha256: bbd537e870c514e851d33275013f0844a77f5e3baf6b63582a3df1da27ae70d3
msgctxt "omake:omake_8A3E8667_5714_4479_945B_89A82141E83A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let us be off, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼 ⟪k:1⟫가 볼까."

#: omake:omake_0D388061_5E2E_478A_ACF1_CABD30013371
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fedea57e09bd6440a851aa11c7eeb66f2e5b430ab7d655922a67f0b03491ad4
#. default-sha256: 1c7ed99fbdf3358f8f917ffbe479d4adfc3a418e78f5dc22b2fae2b896fe9391
msgctxt "omake:omake_0D388061_5E2E_478A_ACF1_CABD30013371"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ah! I found another split end!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Look, this one’s split "
"into three!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫앗, ⟪k:7⟫상한 머리카락 또 찾았어요! ⟪k:8⟫이거 봐요, ⟪k:9⟫끄트머"
"리가 셋으로 갈라졌어요!"

#: omake:omake_C02C6675_80EB_49E5_9A4B_007813BB63CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7965a820c22ce28ebe1939eb01550157916e9a5fa39344b8ba9b4661d655c28d
#. default-sha256: 7eda2714247f5038352e08faadbb782fa0808af95b23a00d6dfa55c743389f84
msgctxt "omake:omake_C02C6675_80EB_49E5_9A4B_007813BB63CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I didn’t actually mean that!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was just, ⟪k:6⟫you know, ⟪k:7⟫a "
"little overwhelmed at the time!⟪k:8⟫About how unexpectedly handsome you were!⟪k:9⟫But I couldn’t "
"bring myself to say it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그, ⟪k:1⟫그건 말이죠! ⟪k:2⟫쑥스러워서 그랬죠……!"

#: omake:omake_DE51EA4A_A870_40CF_91A4_9D835B779A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8928c2d1d84e0fa9fecefffa88500b0ea55a14b6120f06eebc4a527a8e8c2a8f
#. default-sha256: e2e1d74c6077c11b07c82d37d402559258e623c858a09b9b07146bd70203583d
msgctxt "omake:omake_DE51EA4A_A870_40CF_91A4_9D835B779A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I hope you two sickening lovebirds spontaneously combust..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………저주로 갈라져 죽어, 염장 커플………."

#: omake:omake_7F2F89CD_77AE_4D18_96BE_501ABA446818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dda0ea917104315ce8cb3a49c16e24dbeb4f6ab2dfaefc5aca339517ec7643db
#. default-sha256: eb94647b4b4e68b360b1504905fa20156cce131026927d5d9c6e325f6de01f0c
msgctxt "omake:omake_7F2F89CD_77AE_4D18_96BE_501ABA446818"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As the true master of this house, I am everywhere at all times.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Even in "
"the bathrooms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫나는 이 저택의 진정한 주인이라 ⟪k:3⟫언제 어디서나 신출귀몰해. ⟪k:4⟫그래, ⟪k:5⟫네가 "
"용변 볼 때도."

#: omake:omake_05A8DDD2_7450_494D_9A7A_1B323EC72C6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc31cb71d937ab7d7fd5495ed686399875fbd3042e115b01fa67de5821fa87b0
#. default-sha256: e01986c8f97413ed450e873790be239c0d431c7e930984e5ed3f3435b77736e2
msgctxt "omake:omake_05A8DDD2_7450_494D_9A7A_1B323EC72C6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I think that’s enough toilet humor for the time being.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Especially in "
"front of our guest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐 용변 얘기는 그만하자.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫손님 앞이잖아."

#: omake:omake_FD6983FC_6500_4BC7_BE9D_0AC6E8F24B4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 944c80ceac7df945458b082b89dec788f58ebaf961cb8da84454e74b7d1d782e
#. default-sha256: 3986ca2d80eefaf2745e9788f70611583ea8c5919b859fbc52e457bfcce58c48
msgctxt "omake:omake_FD6983FC_6500_4BC7_BE9D_0AC6E8F24B4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It just... ⟪k:2⟫never really seemed that way to me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그게, ⟪k:2⟫자각이 없다 보니……."

#: omake:omake_8BA87D65_BDE0_4565_B0AE_E16CA2BF4C6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d67268f06bc1f42d88becbd50a950c39535f805e3f0481219f42214f864ba71f
#. default-sha256: e3d7c701283c0592206e41af20a4053c70c0682708d1e4b5d7d850bcaf024c56
msgctxt "omake:omake_8BA87D65_BDE0_4565_B0AE_E16CA2BF4C6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But once you reclaimed yourself, you were most definitely playing the protagonist. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Especially the final chapter! You had me swooning by the end!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도 ⟪k:2⟫되찾은 후에는 엄청 주인공다웠어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫특히 최종장! ⟪k:5⟫마지막에 ⟪k:6⟫"
"진짜 멋졌어요."

#: omake:omake_48AEFCD0_9BAB_438B_A1E5_5BD013A1151B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be9e37a0751011980c447cc2d89e80e513f4bb02a99207694a3df2db0ea5d149
#. default-sha256: 53b503ef4981521ca7b19753b3a1d5e2f5a57d53702f7f9d5505e9465541adc6
msgctxt "omake:omake_48AEFCD0_9BAB_438B_A1E5_5BD013A1151B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you think, my dear? ⟪k:3⟫What any respectable behind-the-scenes extra "
"would do, of course—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어머, ⟪k:3⟫뭐긴 뭐겠어.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫무대 뒤답게 ⟪k:6⟫각 방을 돌아다니며――"

#: omake:omake_2A7F3CA3_1134_4621_BF76_8BE0B1176ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb6b37367a5d32add82ff67b01dbe76d25129d654b05995701bea4e66f58bbeb
#. default-sha256: 91928a9b6af7b572b9f0478e241733b2720e8db8d74df67775ce0e6cebafeff3
msgctxt "omake:omake_2A7F3CA3_1134_4621_BF76_8BE0B1176ACB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫we’re going visit each room in the mansion and faff about like a bunch of fools."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하고 싶은 말을 막 하는 거지."

#: omake:omake_060CE94C_E0AE_47B9_9D2B_6BC0BB35989D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e34c3993cfc8af759c8ac0ea46e3871b75101102287eb68689085bdf28df256b
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "omake:omake_060CE94C_E0AE_47B9_9D2B_6BC0BB35989D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: omake:omake_DD46117D_9ECB_4B85_BC2C_B5C1D59040E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd7904d7d50f1e51fb3b3437aef76d0609e76b8cecedb80384206d98a7236fd8
#. default-sha256: 5f297c21ea374daa340837703163807b5eb2cfd931d3d26a3135f4e6ea9f80fc
msgctxt "omake:omake_DD46117D_9ECB_4B85_BC2C_B5C1D59040E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You can’t deny a lot of readers probably didn’t expect the creepy white-haired "
"recluse to turn out to be the main character."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐 그래도 ⟪k:3⟫많은 사람들이 놀랐을걸.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫웬 수상쩍게 생긴 장발맨이 주인공이"
"라잖아."

#: omake:omake_AB7DE4F2_5BDB_46C5_B426_851B3684F16C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56d1a3836c864ebf03c01f2d9efa917e659d6670155a8a5af11f7e1024865906
#. default-sha256: 19be322ad1c59026e9d41bb98a3590c218ff9a55186434b4aa9f7b87523d4f87
msgctxt "omake:omake_AB7DE4F2_5BDB_46C5_B426_851B3684F16C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though perhaps there are some people whose interpretations did not change throughout the "
"course of the tales."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫메인 스트림인 내 이야기로 들어가기 전에도 ⟪k:3⟫1장~3장까지 각기 인식 역전이 일어났"
"지. ⟪k:4⟫역전 안 되고 똑같은 사람도 있었지만."

#: omake:omake_409E38F1_AD87_424A_9225_01F6D09C8F9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e5d97935d036469a347481bfc33617fe7be1e8d6528dd4789b40dee140a177a
#. default-sha256: b9e95a0a81fe2f86379353192d9771885a6ca13b65d0e0be948be4d6891bc863
msgctxt "omake:omake_409E38F1_AD87_424A_9225_01F6D09C8F9D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, that’s not how you pronounce his name.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As I recall, it’s Eucalyptus—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아니, ⟪k:2⟫그 발음이 아닙니다. ⟪k:3⟫아마 ⟪k:4⟫우끼사마――"

#: omake:omake_0563CC2F_1F91_4F15_AA9C_CA7CEC8E9CA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f1471bbbdeb82c94a33c69e668d51fb21221ab81d8553c09d46afc7be733cda
#. default-sha256: 0adcd1f290673cc4f1cadee135d70ec3187e578f4622dd34e75cc90b13d6a948
msgctxt "omake:omake_0563CC2F_1F91_4F15_AA9C_CA7CEC8E9CA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You already made that joke. Let it go, please.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That creature doesn’t need "
"a name. Just call him “the beast.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그거 우려먹지 마, ⟪k:3⟫너희…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그건 짐승이라 부르면 충분해."

#: omake:omake_E6ED0CF4_EA96_43F7_8609_288EDFB5E6DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5f026df1aec494dca1152c18e323d614cf75a67dac461059ab785f78356b66f
#. default-sha256: 2491c794cb8403f2854191754006e8c529278b5e5cea0028eda34c796f23dfab
msgctxt "omake:omake_E6ED0CF4_EA96_43F7_8609_288EDFB5E6DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At the end of that chapter, you learn what kind of man he really was, which then "
"ties into the revelations in the final chapter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫끝에 가서야 드러난 그 남자들의 성질이 ⟪k:3⟫근본적인 성질이란 구조래. ⟪k:4⟫그걸 안 "
"상태로 ⟪k:5⟫최종장까지 연결되는 거지."

#: omake:omake_C5A798EB_B811_4ED8_AFAC_A061A9511D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97ca8909e4dc524c845da922b65a6d7e8936ce693d57e43f548a77cb013ca555
#. default-sha256: 5761beabc7faa87e26966666c2189054245830ab677f6cca8d414d7dfe9a2b3f
msgctxt "omake:omake_C5A798EB_B811_4ED8_AFAC_A061A9511D1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………."

#: omake:omake_50B816BD_A179_493D_9A53_C8C56CE248FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa6a197bb4c10513e4d98e11b9d049921b8664e4a2e135e3bfc5a258eda23c39
#. default-sha256: 99ecb900c01506f22dd8ceb5b928d5fee80759b32fe0260936ed8f0eab84d4f0
msgctxt "omake:omake_50B816BD_A179_493D_9A53_C8C56CE248FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I don’t hold it against you, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 지금은 ⟪k:1⟫뒤끝 없어요."

#: omake:omake_6F5B9841_CFC1_491F_A9B2_FBB2DF203B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59cb807cbf5b514d5733dd7eaa7a2bff960cff8d4105c160ef9d5b29d054f278
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "omake:omake_6F5B9841_CFC1_491F_A9B2_FBB2DF203B6D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

